WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:05.075
Space is expanding, so farther galaxies move away faster, from anywhere.

2
00:00:05.651 --> 00:00:09.426
Here is a field of galaxies. Now let space expand.

3
00:00:14.393 --> 00:00:18.718
Every distance stretches, so farther galaxies move away faster.

4
00:00:19.244 --> 00:00:23.894
Their light is stretched too: redshift. It looks the same from any galaxy.
